# no-serde-json (tools/ci-checks, #162, DEP-3): the paths that may still name serde_json, because
# wave 3 of MIN-3 deletes or rewrites them (ABI-MIN3-WBS W3-D-*; SERDE-JSON-EXIT §4). One path per
# line, relative to the repository root; a line ending in `/` covers the directory below it.
# The list only shrinks: a line under which no file names serde_json any more fails the check, so
# the deleting MR deletes its lines too. Do not add a path here; move the code to busbar_contract::json.

